    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41325" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί-τευξις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hitting the mark, attainment,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκαιρία χρόνου ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Def.</u>
					413c
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>MM</u>
				1207b16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.204S.
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>success,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Pun.</u>
				105
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>conversation,</i>
			
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔντευξις</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				12.1
			</span></i>.</div>
